flowchart TB
    Client["Trình duyệt<br/>HTTP 80<br/>HTTPS 443"]
    Nginx["Nginx non-root<br/>Reverse proxy<br/>Security headers"]
    WP["WordPress & Theme<br/>Cổng thông tin VietNews 24h<br/>Cổng nội bộ 80"]
    MySQL[("MySQL 8.0<br/>vietnews_db · 12 bảng<br/>Volume mysql_data")]
    PMA["phpMyAdmin<br/>127.0.0.1:8081"]

    Exp["Exporters<br/>Nginx & MySQL<br/>cAdvisor container"]
    LogVol["Volumes log<br/>Docker Socket API<br/>Nginx access/error"]

    Graf["Grafana<br/>127.0.0.1:3000<br/>Dashboard & Explore"]
    Prom["Prometheus<br/>127.0.0.1:9090<br/>Scrape 15s"]
    Promtail["Promtail<br/>Đọc Docker Socket<br/>Gắn nhãn job, service"]
    Loki[("Loki<br/>127.0.0.1:3100<br/>TSDB & filesystem")]

    Client -->|request| Nginx
    Nginx -->|proxy| WP
    WP -->|SQL| MySQL
    PMA -->|mạng database| MySQL

    Nginx -.->|ghi metrics| Exp
    MySQL -.->|exporter_user| Exp
    WP -.->|stdout/stderr| LogVol
    Nginx -.->|stdout/stderr| LogVol

    Exp -->|metrics| Prom
    Prom -->|PromQL| Graf
    LogVol -->|thu gom| Promtail
    Promtail -->|push log| Loki
    Graf -.->|LogQL qua mạng monitoring| Loki
